        <body>
            <div xml:id="d57">

                <pb facs="0144" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg76"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">In the House of Representatives,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 27, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Banks, from the Committee on Foreign Affairs, submitted the following, which
                    was adopted:</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved,</hi> That this House extends its sympathy to
                    the people of Ireland and of Candia in in their just efforts to maintain the
                    independence of states, to elevate the people, and to extend and perpetuate the
                    principles of liberty.</p>



